{
  "_about": "Hand-labelled routing cases. 'expect' is the unambiguous right answer under the app's own system prompt: kind 'agent' (route to one of 'agents'), 'new' (create a new agent), or 'none' (just reply). 'required_agents' are placed in every roster (correct answers plus deliberate confusers). 'exclude' lists terms no padding agent may contain, so padding never adds a second reasonable answer. Debatable cases were left out on purpose.",
